	(text "NOTES TO SELF:\n- I messed up the DPDT switch footprint's pin numbering\n- a few B.Cu traces need some attention. Especially towards the board edge\n- also 3PDT wiring is messed up. pins 4 and 5 are switched up\n- change coupling cap values to align with reality\n- audioprobe leg 1 of C24\n- you flipped an op-amp dumbass (U2A)\n"
